8. 8-Project-Demonstration
ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models
Project Demonstration
1. Demonstration Overview
The ComicCraft demonstration showcases how a user can create a complete comic story with the help of Gemini models.
The demonstration should follow the complete application workflow:
Login → Create Comic → Enter Story Idea → Generate Story → Generate Characters → Generate Panels → Edit Comic → Preview → Export
The demonstration can be performed using a sample story such as:
“A young astronaut discovers an abandoned city on a distant planet.”
________________________________________
2. Demonstration Objectives
The demonstration should show that ComicCraft can:
•	Accept a user's story idea.
•	Generate a story using Gemini.
•	Generate characters.
•	Generate scenes and comic panels.
•	Generate dialogue and narration.
•	Create visual prompts/images where supported.
•	Allow users to edit the generated comic.
•	Preview the final comic.
•	Export the comic.
