18. Error Demonstration
A good project demonstration should also show basic error handling.
Example 1 – Empty story idea
Click Generate without entering a story idea.
Expected:
"Please enter a story idea."
Example 2 – AI failure
Simulate an AI/API failure.
Expected:
"Story generation failed. Please try again."
Example 3 – Unauthorized project
Attempt to access another user's project.
Expected:
Access denied.
This demonstrates that the application handles errors and protects user data.
