19. Complete Demo Script
During a project presentation, the demonstration can be explained as follows:
"First, the user logs into ComicCraft. From the dashboard, the user creates a new comic and enters a simple story idea. The user selects the genre, language, number of pages, and art style. When the Generate button is clicked, the backend sends the structured request to the Gemini model. Gemini generates the story and related comic information. The application then displays the generated characters, scenes, panels, dialogue, narration, and visual prompts. The user can edit any generated content using the comic editor. After completing the editing process, the user previews the comic and exports it as a PDF or image pages. The project is also saved so that it can be edited later."
________________________________________
